{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_505_en_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_505_en_02_title", "source_sha256": "14411d86100827300fdab8fa9f8f4d6c250493b696e5a575bc0113a010bf4310", "ja": "Twelw@ve DAY2 留守電", "zh": "Twelw@ve DAY2 留言电话", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_505_en_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_505_en_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "62d17e0e114927c149d9d5658913c59bce42d132a7c4c4e1e60ad5f330f0b483", "ja": "Twelw@ve DAY2を無事に終えた\n美也からの留守番電話です。", "zh": "顺利结束了Twelw@ve DAY2的\n美也打来的留言电话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_505_en_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_505_en_02_1000_042miy", "source_sha256": "31b0f9f015e986797b18f68233b563b7b7764759b90135d93fbe37b076b1003e", "ja": "{$P$}さん、こんばんは～。\nライブ、お疲れさまでした～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，晚上好～。\n演出辛苦了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_505_en_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_505_en_02_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "ba15e310a8d302b5df4bfb5162ab0dc29a6c784ffce55cf968850142ed3c6924", "ja": "なんだか、あっという間に終わってしまいましたね～。\nファンのみなさんが楽しめたか、心配です～。む～ん。", "zh": "总觉得转眼间就结束了呢～  \n不知道粉丝们有没有享受到，我有点担心～唔～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_505_en_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_505_en_02_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "4a22e7c5f10d2838539adbb69a97c68742147c5ac39f87d2adcc350326e0bf67", "ja": "でも、そうでした～。楽しい時間は、\nあっという間に過ぎると言いますから……。", "zh": "不过，确实是这样呢～。都说快乐的时光总是转瞬即逝……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_505_en_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_505_en_02_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "99bdc91b8228c7437bd07cfdd3cfbe590112c656205ff1c8683bdb825e41aa09", "ja": "今日を一瞬に感じてしまうくらい、\n私は、楽しかったのかもしれません～。", "zh": "开心到让我觉得今天转瞬即逝，或许我真的玩得很开心呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_505_en_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_505_en_02_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "2c6655838b57c17dbe1aa1530e1faeec3df8129b8159edb3c73a8f1cad80bd5d", "ja": "なので、ファンのみなさんが、私と同じように\n心から楽しんでくれていると、いいですな～。", "zh": "所以，希望各位粉丝也能像我一样发自内心地享受其中～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_505_en_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_505_en_02_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "4555f695f83469648977331fd4b85fc680bb17bd0bfd4651227f00aab99a44b5", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、楽しかったですか～？\n今度、私にも感想を聞かせてくださいね～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生开心吗～？\n下次也请把您的感想告诉我哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_505_en_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_505_en_02_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "83ede083f3333f9c5de185a57d4e4c98608c3e870f3fa25df7395bb0a32a6df8", "ja": "ライブは終わってしまいましたけど……\n日付が変わったら、次はバレンタインですよ～。", "zh": "虽然演唱会已经结束了……  \n等日期一变，接下来就是情人节了哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_505_en_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_505_en_02_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "6ffa8e825ce83f8b94aff6c07e37812bfbde0862d1d37a14de32ef653adffc8c", "ja": "楽しいことが続くのは、素敵ですな～。\n{$P$}さんも、そう思いませんか～？", "zh": "开心的事情一件接着一件，真是太棒了呢～。\n{$P$}先生，您也这么觉得吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_505_en_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_505_en_02_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "2439b55e071af8973704f3feafc7eb8438131d06fdabd706f575ff1cd69f2847", "ja": "今日のライブが、私たちからファンのみなさんへの、\n贈り物になっていたらいいですね～。むふふ。", "zh": "要是今天的演出能成为我们送给各位粉丝的礼物，那就太好了～。唔呼呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_505_en_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_505_en_02_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "8e9c1ea94dddf2d75b2b1580f38c95ef3d39cfc88658367fa33cd54585d5bb7d", "ja": "私も、楽しい気持ちをたくさん届けられるように。\nまた明日から、がんばりますよ～。", "zh": "我也会努力把许多快乐的心情传递给大家。从明天开始，我也要继续加油了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_505_en_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_505_en_02_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "678dd02de5d219d5f6c571222bbead853bfc1148dc74195ebd0385f77451cc84", "ja": "{$P$}さん。どうかこれからも、\nよろしくお願いしますね～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生。今后也请您，\n多多关照喽～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_505_en_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_505_en_02_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "58d0e8d8519b58b6702dffdfb95a7be0ec7ad527a689a725f6466731f1c55981", "ja": "……おや～？　今、気がついたのですが……。", "zh": "……哎呀～？我刚刚才发现……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_505_en_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_505_en_02_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "6409ee4feecbdfe0bfef704760df9557b6e308f8308ada22267c89f022868ede", "ja": "自分の名前を言うのを、忘れていた気がしますよ～？\nなんと～。うっかりしていましたな～。", "zh": "感觉好像忘了说自己的名字～？真是的～一不小心忘掉了呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_505_en_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_505_en_02_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "5a842b1aaae23aff08001516ed2f676eb107da6df10ac186c50bbdf0809e29cc", "ja": "それでは{$P$}さん、また、明日。\n宮尾美也でした～。", "zh": "那么，{$P$}先生，明天再见。\n我是宫尾美也～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
